    27  44  4.86  034  +18  1.4  6.0  3.0  1.7  # LRUD 44
    44  45  3.65  343  -37  0  1.0  0.8  0.8  # LRUD 45
    45  46  3.8  030  -2  1.6  0  1  0.5  # LRUD 46
    
